WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.757
Welcome to Module 1. We are building the Python foundation that every later analytics module depends on.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:14.977
We will focus on how Python stores values, understands data types, performs calculations,

00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:21.072
and produces readable output. The goal is not memorizing isolated syntax.

00:00:21.072 --> 00:00:26.240
The goal is to understand how small pieces of code represent a real analytical idea.
